# Video Parallel Scaling: Scaling VideoLLMs by Aggregating Diverse Frame Subsets

> Authors: [Hyungjin Chung](https://hyungjin-chung.github.io/), [Hyelin Nam](https://hyelinnam.github.io/), [Jiyeon Kim](https://jiyeonkimd.github.io/), [Hyojun Go](https://gohyojun15.github.io/), [Byeongjun Park](https://byeongjun-park.github.io/), [Junho Kim](https://www.linkedin.com/in/junho-kim-7a3ba916a/?originalSubdomain=kr), [Joonseok Lee](https://jsleeo424.github.io/), [Seongsu Ha](https://seongsuha.github.io/), and [Byung-Hoon Kim](https://egyptdj.notion.site/NAIPL-f6283de309a04223b1c04793f5a10ce1)

This repo contains the official implementation of the paper "[Video Parallel Scaling: Aggregating Diverse Frame Subsets for VideoLLMs](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.08016)".

